ְּלָ֑תָּה</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ezek 14:15\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"14\" vBegin=\"15\" cEnd=\"14\" vEnd=\"15\" onclick=\"bcv(26,14,15)\">Ezek 14:15</ref>, etc.; <highlight>Imperfect</highlight> 3 feminine singular <bdbheb>תְּשַׁכֵּל</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Deut 32:25\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"32\" vBegin=\"25\" cEnd=\"32\" vEnd=\"25\" onclick=\"bcv(5,32,25)\">Deut 32:25</ref> +, 2 feminine singular <bdbheb>תְּשַׁכְּלִי</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ezek 36:14\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"36\" vBegin=\"14\" cEnd=\"36\" vEnd=\"14\" onclick=\"bcv(26,36,14)\">Ezek 36:14</ref> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Qr')\"><reflink>Qr</reflink></lookup> (see  <bdbheb><reflink>כָּשַׁל</reflink></bdbheb> <b>Pi`el</b>); <highlight>Infinitive construct</highlight> suffix <bdbheb>לְשַׁכְּלָם</bdbheb> v<ref ref=\"Ezek 36:12\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"36\" vBegin=\"12\" cEnd=\"36\" vEnd=\"12\" onclick=\"bcv(26,36,12)\">Ezek 36:12</ref> <highlight>Participle</highlight> <bdbheb>מְשַׁכֵּלָה</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Exod 23:26\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"23\" vBegin=\"26\" cEnd=\"23\" vEnd=\"26\" onclick=\"bcv(2,23,26)\">Exod 23:26</ref>, <bdbheb>כֶּ֫לֶת</bdbheb>- <ref ref=\"Ezek 36:13\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"36\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"36\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(26,36,13)\">Ezek 36:13</ref>, <bdbheb>כָּ֫לֶת</bdbheb>- — <ref ref=\"2Kgs 2:19\" b=\"12\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"19\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"19\" onclick=\"bcv(12,2,19)\">2Kgs 2:19</ref>; <ref ref=\"2Kgs 2:21\" b=\"12\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"21\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"21\" onclick=\"bcv(12,2,21)\">2Kgs 2:21</ref> — </div><div class=\"point\"><b>1.</b> <highlight>make childless</highlight>, accusative of father <ref ref=\"Gen 42:36\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"42\" vBegin=\"36\" cEnd=\"42\" vEnd=\"36\" onclick=\"bcv(1,42,36)\">Gen 42:36</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('E')\"><reflink>E</reflink></lookup>), of mothers <ref ref=\"1Sam 15:33\" b=\"9\" cBegin=\"15\" vBegin=\"33\" cEnd=\"15\" vEnd=\"33\" onclick=\"bcv(9,15,33)\">1Sam 15:33</ref> (subject <bdbheb>חֶרֶב</bdbheb>), compare <ref ref=\"Ezek 5:17\" b=\"26\" c