21\" onclick=\"bcv(12,2,21)\">2Kgs 2:21</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Thes')\">Thes</lookup> otherwise, see <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>מְשׁ</bdbheb> infra). <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>b.</b> <highlight>shew barrenness</highlight>, or <highlight>abortion</highlight>, (1) of any female <ref ref=\"Exod 23:26\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"23\" vBegin=\"26\" cEnd=\"23\" vEnd=\"26\" onclick=\"bcv(2,23,26)\">Exod 23:26</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('E')\"><reflink>E</reflink></lookup>; + <bdbheb>עֲקָרָה</bdbheb>), animals <ref ref=\"Gen 31:38\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"31\" vBegin=\"38\" cEnd=\"31\" vEnd=\"38\" onclick=\"bcv(1,31,38)\">Gen 31:38</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('E')\"><reflink>E</reflink></lookup>) <ref ref=\"Job 21:10\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"21\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"21\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(18,21,10)\">Job 21:10</ref> (2) of vine <ref ref=\"Mal 3:11\" b=\"39\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(39,3,11)\">Mal 3:11</ref>. <b>Hiph`il</b> <highlight>Participle</highlight> <bdbheb>רֶהֶם</bdbheb> (<bdbheb>וְשָׁדַיִם צֹמְקִים</bdbheb>) <bdbheb>מַשְׁכִּיל</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Hos 9:14\" b=\"28\" cBegin=\"9\" vBegin=\"14\" cEnd=\"9\" vEnd=\"14\" onclick=\"bcv(28,9,14)\">Hos 9:14</ref> <highlight>miscarrying womb</highlight>. — <ref ref=\"Jer 50:9\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"50\" vBegin=\"9\" cEnd=\"50\" vEnd=\"9\" onclick=\"bcv(24,50,9)\">Jer 50:9</ref> read <bdbheb>מַשְׂכִּיל</bdbheb> <highlight>successful</highlight>, <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Sept')\"><bdbheb><reflink>ᵐ5</reflink></bdbheb></lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Syr')\"><bdbheb><reflink>ᵑ6</reflink></bdbheb></lookup> Heb Manuscripts <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Ew')\">Ew</lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Hi')\">Hi</lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Gf')\">Gf</lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Gie')\">Gie</lookup>. </p></div><hr>", "references": [{"raw": "Gen 43:14", "book": "GEN", "chapter": 43, "verse": 14}, {"raw": "Gen 27:45", "book": "GEN", "chapter": 27, "verse": 45}, {"raw": "1Sam 15:33", "b